      "description": "Watch Platense vs Boca Juniors highlights and goals from Argentine Primera División on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 16, 2026. Strategic Battle in the Liga Profesional On August 16, 2026, Platense hosted Boca Juniors in a high-stakes Liga Profesional Argentina fixture that demanded maximum concentration from both squads. The match began with a cagey atmosphere, as neither team was willing to concede ground, leading to a physical battle across the midfield that defined the rhythm of the opening half. Momentum Swings and Late Response The narrative shifted significantly in the second half when Nicolas Retamar broke the deadlock in the 53rd minute, firing Platense into the lead. With the home side gaining momentum, Boca Juniors turned to their bench, introducing fresh energy to salvage their campaign. This tactical shift proved effective as the visitors began to pressure the defensive line with renewed intensity. With just ten minutes remaining in regulation, Miguel Merentiel emerged as the hero for the visitors, converting a decisive goal after being set up by Santiago Ascacibar . Despite the frantic efforts from both sides to snatch a late winner and the referee handing out late cautions to maintain order, the scoreline remained level at the final whistle, concluding an intense afternoon of football ."
